{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mbody the Spirit of Journalism, and navigate the campus and historical rifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview: An interactive narrative puzzle game that drives the storyline through exploration, mission completion, and character interactions. It is a thematic adventure guided by the spirit of journalism and the evolution of news dissemination across China and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, players will explore, advance the plot, and collect items while interacting with various NPCs to experience and learn about the history of journalism. Tackle dual-line puzzles using the \u300cInk Bottle Strategy\u300d, confront personified negative entities, accomplish in-depth reporting missions, and develop emotional bonds with multiple characters. Unravel the protagonist\u2019s origins and unveil the centuries-old bonds intertwined with the spirit of journalism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth awaits your pen\u2014write it into existence!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918520?t=1758284859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918520/d6d5e10a781cf3679791d2d837f00f5bba7d351c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758284859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918520/bc1c58561b93a247fbed75a4bd57e6652b2b3483/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758284859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918520/bc1c58561b93a247fbed75a4bd57e6652b2b3483/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758284859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mbody the Spirit of Journalism, and navigate the campus and historical rifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview: An interactive narrative puzzle game that drives the storyline through explora